1
00:00:07,441 --> 00:00:08,771
(Leonard:)What are you doing?

2
00:00:08,776 --> 00:00:10,106
(Leonard:)It's time to go.

3
00:00:10,111 --> 00:00:12,141
(Sheldon:)I'm not going to work today.

4
00:00:12,146 --> 00:00:14,146
(Sheldon:)And would you like
to know why?

5
00:00:14,148 --> 00:00:17,148
(Leonard:)Ah, you're upset because you
spent the whole night working

6
00:00:17,151 --> 00:00:19,151
(Leonard:)on dark matter
and didn't make a breakthrough,

7
00:00:19,153 --> 00:00:21,153
(Leonard:)and now you're worried you made
a huge mistake switching fields,

8
00:00:21,155 --> 00:00:23,285
(Leonard:)and you're gonna sit around
and sulk all day?

9
00:00:23,291 --> 00:00:26,091
(Sheldon:)Like a big old baby.

10
00:00:27,662 --> 00:00:29,032
(Leonard:)Call me
if you need anything.

11
00:00:30,631 --> 00:00:32,631
(Sheldon sighs, door closes)

12
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:36,003
(Sheldon:)I've been cooped up
in here too long.

13
00:00:36,003 --> 00:00:38,873
(Sheldon:)Maybe I need some fresh air.

14
00:00:41,375 --> 00:00:45,115
(inhales, exhales)

15
00:00:49,217 --> 00:00:52,287
(Penny groans,
grunts)

16
00:00:57,225 --> 00:00:58,225
(Sheldon:)Penny?

17
00:00:58,226 --> 00:00:59,396
(grunts)

18
00:00:59,393 --> 00:01:00,393
(Sheldon:)Penny?

19
00:01:00,394 --> 00:01:01,394
(grunts)

